  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "3. Add chicken to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "4. Thread chicken and vegetables onto kebab skewers.",
    "5. Brush kebabs with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "6. Grill kebabs for 8-10 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Warm pita bread by wrapping it in foil and heating it in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "8. Assemble shawarma by slicing kebabs and serving on pita bread with tahini sauce and lemon wedges."
